SOAPBOX: Every year in Türkiye, TA2FE Emin Bora organizes an extensive Morse code course. Throughout this long-term training, amateur radio operators learn and practice Morse in depth.
SOAPBOX: After successfully completing the course, participants join the CQ WW CW Contest at the TC2E contest station, gaining their first contest experience.
SOAPBOX: We would like to thank all operators who make QSOs with us for their patience. As this is their first experience, log errors may occur we appreciate your understanding.
SOAPBOX: Hope to meet you again in the next contest!
